1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
This world overflows with color

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Truth and lies confuse our eyes

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Use your heart to truly see

6
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The truth lies just ahead

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Hey you could do better

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Truth and lies

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Can't escape this soul's gray haze

10
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Bring along all your courage

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
And maybe you can save the world

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

14
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Mr. K surrendered?

16
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
This way

17
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:36,500
I failed you, sir

18
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:38,419
He got away by jumping into the river

19
00:02:38,419 --> 00:02:39,680
But he's already injured

20
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,439
He can't have gone far

21
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,180
Actually, Dottie

22
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:43,360
Dorothy

23
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,920
You don't need to blame yourself

24
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,620
A revealed sin

25
00:02:46,620 --> 00:02:48,819
Is far better than a disguised virtue

26
00:02:48,819 --> 00:02:50,000
Shaker

27
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,659
Here.

28
00:02:50,659 --> 00:02:52,439
You have three days

29
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:54,599
to find Mr. K, who stole the Doctrine fragment.

30
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,780
Do not fail.

31
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:56,919
Understood.

32
00:02:56,919 --> 00:02:59,359
Dorothy.

33
00:02:59,359 --> 00:02:59,979
Here.

34
00:02:59,979 --> 00:03:03,359
Immediately begin collecting the Eternal Flame.

35
00:03:03,359 --> 00:03:05,960
There must be no mistakes this time.

36
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:08,780
Don't let me down again.

37
00:03:08,780 --> 00:03:12,000
I swear on my honor and charm.

38
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,900
This time, I won't disappoint you.

39
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:26,439
Please save me, Miss Jingjing.

40
00:04:32,439 --> 00:04:34,439
What did you just say?

41
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:40,439
I know your heart is as pure and kind as an angel's.

42
00:04:40,439 --> 00:04:44,439
So please, you have to save me.

43
00:04:45,439 --> 00:04:48,439
You say I'm pure and kind?

44
00:04:48,439 --> 00:04:51,439
Yes, yes, and gentle and cute.

45
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:54,439
Gentle and cute?

46
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:57,439
Locky has never said that about me.

47
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:59,439
Of course cute, of course.

48
00:04:59,439 --> 00:05:01,439
I'm telling the truth.

49
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:04,439
So please, you have to save me.

50
00:05:05,439 --> 00:05:08,439
Then how do you want me to save you?

51
00:05:14,439 --> 00:05:17,439
Ever since I failed my last mission,

52
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:20,439
everyone at the Illumin-Eye treats me like dirt.

53
00:05:20,439 --> 00:05:23,439
Lord Eye finally kicked me out.

54
00:05:23,439 --> 00:05:25,439
So I stole the remaining copy of the Illumin Doctrine

55
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:28,439
and decided to leave the Illumin-Eye for good,

56
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:32,439
to confess all their evil deeds to the police.

57
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:36,439
But instead, I got viciously hunted down.

58
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:39,439
Oh, you poor thing.

59
00:05:40,439 --> 00:05:44,439
Don't worry. Jingjing will get you to the police station safe and sound.

60
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:46,439
Really?

61
00:05:47,439 --> 00:05:49,439
Give me your hand.

62
00:05:50,439 --> 00:06:01,639
Wha— What is this place?

63
00:06:01,639 --> 00:06:04,759
Miss Jingjing? W-Where are you?

64
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:07,740
Mr. K, off to the police station we go!

65
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:20,379
Jingjing, why are you here today?

66
00:06:20,379 --> 00:06:21,379
Locky!

67
00:06:21,379 --> 00:06:23,379
Today, it's just Jingjing.

68
00:06:23,379 --> 00:06:26,379
I brought a poor uncle.

69
00:06:27,379 --> 00:06:28,379
Where is he?

70
00:06:28,379 --> 00:06:29,379
I don't see him.

71
00:06:32,379 --> 00:06:33,379
Hold on.

72
00:06:33,379 --> 00:06:35,379
I'll show him to you right away.

73
00:06:35,379 --> 00:06:36,379
He's right here.

74
00:06:36,379 --> 00:06:37,379
Come on.

75
00:06:41,379 --> 00:06:42,379
Jingjing?

76
00:06:42,379 --> 00:06:43,379
What are you doing?

77
00:06:43,379 --> 00:06:44,379
A ghost!

78
00:06:48,379 --> 00:06:49,379
Mr.K

79
00:06:49,379 --> 00:06:51,379
Don't play the pity card.

80
00:06:51,379 --> 00:06:53,379
What trick are you up to this time?

81
00:06:53,379 --> 00:06:54,379
Confess quickly.

82
00:06:54,379 --> 00:06:55,379
No, no, no.

83
00:06:55,379 --> 00:06:57,379
I've already told you everything.

84
00:06:57,379 --> 00:06:59,379
This time it's all the truth.

85
00:06:59,379 --> 00:07:01,379
Please, you have to believe me.

86
00:07:01,379 --> 00:07:02,379
See?

87
00:07:02,379 --> 00:07:04,379
That's about it for the preliminary statement.

88
00:07:04,379 --> 00:07:06,379
Now we move on to the details.

89
00:07:06,379 --> 00:07:08,379
Sima.

90
00:07:08,379 --> 00:07:09,379
Continue.

91
00:07:09,379 --> 00:07:10,379
Yes.

92
00:07:10,379 --> 00:07:12,379
We'll continue with the questions.

93
00:07:12,379 --> 00:07:13,379
Mr.K.

94
00:07:13,379 --> 00:07:15,379
Why did you leave The Illumin-Eye?

95
00:07:15,379 --> 00:07:16,379
And volunteer to be a witness against them?

96
00:07:16,379 --> 00:07:18,379
Hurry up and confess.

97
00:07:18,379 --> 00:07:20,680
I've already said it twice!

98
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,620
Don't talk so sloppily. Answer now!

99
00:07:22,620 --> 00:07:24,339
Okay, okay.

100
00:07:24,339 --> 00:07:25,879
It's like this.

101
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:29,279
Since I failed to steal the Colitas flower,

102
00:07:29,279 --> 00:07:31,300
the people in the Illumin-Eye

103
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:33,800
all mock me as a good-for-nothing.

104
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:36,279
It really stings inside.

105
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:40,180
I used to do all the grunt work.

106
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:42,060
But just because of one tiny failure,

107
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:43,800
I end up like this.

108
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,560
I've seen how cold the world is.

109
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:48,100
So I decided to leave the Illumin-Eye and throw in with you lot.

110
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:49,340
To show my sincerity,

111
00:07:49,340 --> 00:07:50,820
I stole the Illumin-Eye's precious book,

112
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:51,780
The Illumin Doctrine,

113
00:07:51,780 --> 00:07:52,980
as a gift for you all.

114
00:07:53,580 --> 00:07:54,180
Well?

115
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:56,300
Ask him again.

116
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:57,500
Where is the ancient book now?

117
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:58,980
Sima.

118
00:07:59,580 --> 00:08:00,820
Let's continue the questioning.

119
00:08:00,820 --> 00:08:02,780
Where is that ancient book you mentioned?

120
00:08:03,460 --> 00:08:04,340
Ancient book...

121
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:05,180
Ancient book...

122
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:06,379
Where's the ancient book?

123
00:08:06,379 --> 00:08:08,140
Where did the ancient book go?

124
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,180
Ancient book...

125
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:09,980
Ancient book...

126
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:11,780
The ancient book

127
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:12,700
It's missing.

128
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:13,500
Missing?

129
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:14,420
Who are you trying to fool?

130
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:16,379
I think you hid it yourself.

131
00:08:16,379 --> 00:08:17,100
If you still won't be honest,

132
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:19,100
don't blame us for getting rough.

133
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:28,100
This paper lists the names of all Illumin-Eye members,

134
00:08:28,100 --> 00:08:30,100
and the exact location of their secret headquarters.

135
00:08:30,100 --> 00:08:32,100
Since you don't believe I lost the ancient book,

136
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:35,100
then this paper is the only proof of my sincerity.

137
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:36,100
Besides, I overheard that

138
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:40,100
Dorothy is going to steal an ancient sword called the Eternal Flame from the museum.

139
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:43,100
Apparently, this ancient sword is vital

140
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:45,100
to the Illumin-Eye's ultimate plan.

141
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:48,100
I risked my life to tell you everything I know.

142
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:50,100
Whether you believe it is up to you.

143
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:54,100
Seems being a good person is really, really hard.

144
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:56,100
What do you think?

145
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:58,100
I'd believe anyone else,

146
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:01,100
but Mr.K is a master of deception.

147
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:03,100
I find it suspicious too.

148
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:04,100
Inspector Sima.

149
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:05,100
Here.

150
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:08,100
Take your men and use the list Mr.K provided.

151
00:09:08,100 --> 00:09:10,100
Arrest the members of the Illumin-Eye

152
00:09:11,100 --> 00:09:14,100
Jimmy, go to the service center and find the Eternal Flame

153
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:18,100
I'll take the backup squad to the Illumin-Eye base immediately

154
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,100
Hello?

155
00:09:20,100 --> 00:09:22,100
Anyone here?

156
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:23,100
Hello?

157
00:09:34,100 --> 00:09:35,100
Report!

158
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:38,100
No Illumin-Eye members found in the other rooms

159
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:39,100
As expected, they got away

160
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,100
Secure the scene

161
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:42,100
Go notify the tech team

162
00:09:42,100 --> 00:09:45,100
Keep looking for new leads

163
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:46,100
Yes, sir

164
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:15,620
Saying goodbye to today

165
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:20,040
Always feels a little lost

166
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:23,440
Look at tomorrow

167
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:27,779
Waving to me on the horizon

168
00:10:27,779 --> 00:10:31,519
Each day is just sunrise and sunset

169
00:10:31,519 --> 00:10:35,500
Turning through time, imagining more

170
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:38,060
In life, I look forward to

171
00:10:38,060 --> 00:10:40,540
Every second, every moment

172
00:10:40,539 --> 00:10:47,259
My bright eyes are gleaming

173
00:10:47,259 --> 00:10:50,620
A smile greeting the sun

174
00:10:50,620 --> 00:10:55,839
It weeps softly at the blinking crossroads